	"Description": "把预设的猫替换成博德之门3的翼猫塔拉\n<br />Replaced the default cat with Tara the Tressym from Baldur's Gate 3\n<br />\n<br />默认替换第一只猫，如果想替换其他猫，需要更改content.json里Target和FromFile里的文件名，比如要换cat2就把cat改成cat2记得图片的文件名也要改\n<br />Replace the first cat by default, if you want to replace other cats, you need to change the file name in the Target and FromFile in the content.json\n<br />for example, if you want to change cat2, change cat to cat2, remember to change the file name of the image\n<br />\n<br />理论上所有猫都能换，我还没测试过新领养的猫替换会怎样，不过就换个图片的事应该没事，操作正确可以实现复数塔拉\n<br />\n<br />2024-4-2 添加了AT版本\n<br />added AT version",
